      "@id": "sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/qa-reports.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "QA reports — derived results on a branch, judgements on `main`",
      "prov:value": "| | derived | judgement |\n|---|---|---|\n| what | every `reviewer.kind: script` entry: `kg-qa/**`, `*.qa-results.json`, witnesses, `lsi/`, `tool-runs/`, the health report | agent, human and **baseline-pair** attestations (the owner ruled a baseline is a judgement) |\n| graph typology | `qa` (and `health`) | `attestations` |\n| written to | `<instance>/test/results/**`, the **working copy** | `<instance>/test/attestations/<family>/<mirrored subject path>.attestations.json` |\n| record | the orphan **`qa-reports`** branch, `main/<sha>/` or `pr/<n>/<sha>/` | **`main`** (ruling D2 (a)) |\n| schema | the family's own | `qa-attestations/v1`, `schemas/sdlc/qa-attestations.ts` |\n| on a merge conflict | take the base's side (`merge:main`), then regenerate | a person reads both sides |",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "D2"
      ]
    },
